# Milestones active in this release (see docs/workflow.md). Scripts of a milestone that is not
# listed stop with "ACTION: SETUP ..." (exit 10) and do nothing.
# Enabling a milestone is the developer's decision - an agent must not edit this file on its own.
# One-off override without editing: export FW_ACTIVE_MILESTONES="M1 M2"
#
#   M1 bring-up         setup, create, IDE, build, connect, flash (asks first), test, debug   active
#   M2 board support    board drivers, layer check, host test (optional)                    layer check implemented, gated
#   M3 execution model  bare metal / RTOS / Zephyr, trace                                     planned
#   M4 components       middleware (LVGL, USB, file system, network ...)                     planned
#   M5 application      on-board tests with stub/driver inputs, profiling                    planned
ACTIVE_MILESTONES="M1"
